sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant Gateway as data-science-gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant NodeJS as odh-dashboard<br/>(Node.js)<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant BFF as core-bff<br/>8943/TCP HTTPS
    participant ModBFF as Module BFF Pod<br/>8080/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ExtSvc as External Services<br/>(Llama Stack, MaaS, MLflow,<br/>MCP, NeMo, TrustyAI)

    Note over Browser,K8sAPI: Flow 1: User Dashboard Access

    Browser->>Gateway: GET / (HTTPS/443)<br/>Session cookie
    Gateway->>Proxy: Forward (HTTPS/8443)<br/>TLS (service-ca)
    Proxy->>Proxy: OpenShift auth check<br/>(project list verification)
    Proxy->>NodeJS: Forward (HTTP/8080 loopback)<br/>x-forwarded-access-token
    NodeJS-->>Browser: React SPA (HTML/JS/CSS)

    Note over Browser,K8sAPI: Flow 1b: K8s API Proxy Call

    Browser->>Gateway: POST /api/k8s/* (HTTPS/443)<br/>Bearer Token
    Gateway->>Proxy: Forward (HTTPS/8443)
    Proxy->>NodeJS: Forward with x-forwarded-access-token
    NodeJS->>K8sAPI: K8s API call (HTTPS/6443)<br/>User Impersonation (Bearer → Impersonate headers)
    K8sAPI-->>NodeJS: K8s Response (RBAC-scoped)
    NodeJS-->>Browser: JSON Response

    Note over Browser,ExtSvc: Flow 2: BFF API Call

    Browser->>Gateway: POST /api/v1alpha1/* (HTTPS/443)<br/>Bearer Token
    Gateway->>BFF: Forward (HTTPS/8943)<br/>TLS (service-ca cert)
    BFF->>BFF: Auth: Bearer Token validation
    BFF->>K8sAPI: K8s API call (HTTPS/6443)<br/>Bearer Token (user or SA)
    K8sAPI-->>BFF: K8s Response
    BFF-->>Browser: JSON Response

    Note over Browser,ExtSvc: Flow 3: Federated Module Load

    Browser->>Gateway: GET /_mf/gen-ai/* (HTTPS/443)<br/>user_token
    Gateway->>Proxy: Forward (HTTPS/8443)
    Proxy->>NodeJS: Forward with x-forwarded-access-token
    NodeJS->>ModBFF: Fetch module remote (HTTPS/8080)<br/>Internal auth
    ModBFF-->>NodeJS: Module Federation Remote Entry
    NodeJS-->>Browser: JS Module Bundle

    Note over Browser,ExtSvc: Flow 3b: Module BFF API Call

    Browser->>Gateway: POST /gen-ai/api/v1/* (HTTPS/443)<br/>Bearer Token
    Gateway->>ModBFF: Forward (HTTPS/8080)<br/>TLS (service-ca)
    ModBFF->>ModBFF: RequireAccessToService middleware
    ModBFF->>K8sAPI: K8s API (HTTPS/6443)
    ModBFF->>ExtSvc: External call (HTTPS)<br/>Bearer Token / API Key
    ExtSvc-->>ModBFF: Response
    ModBFF-->>Browser: JSON Response
